<section class="band-navy" aria-labelledby="audit-title">
  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How they are built</p>
      <h2 id="audit-title">AI you can trace</h2>
      <p>Government organisations have to explain what their tools say. These solutions are built so that every answer can be traced and checked, and so that a question without a source gets a clear "no" rather than a guess.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="principles" role="list">
      <li>
        <span class="value-icon"><span class="ico ico--link"></span></span>
        <h3>Every answer shows its source</h3>
        <p>Answers and figures link back to the page, workbook or report they came from, so a reader can check them before acting.</p>
        <p class="seen">Seen in: <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/answerhatch/">AnswerHatch</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/foi-at-a-glance/">FOI at a Glance</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/ndb-insights/">NDB Insights</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/bluebird-horizon-workforce-planning/">Horizon</a></p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="value-icon"><span class="ico ico--bar"></span></span>
        <h3>The model never writes a figure</h3>
        <p>Numbers are computed by the platform from the source data. The language model explains, drafts and lays out. It does not produce the numbers.</p>
        <p class="seen">Seen in: <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/bluebird-horizon-workforce-planning/">Horizon</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/ndb-insights/">NDB Insights</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/foi-at-a-glance/">FOI at a Glance</a></p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="value-icon"><span class="ico ico--slash"></span></span>
        <h3>No source, no answer</h3>
        <p>When the sources don't cover a question, the solution says so. Gaps in published data stay visible as gaps.</p>
        <p class="seen">Seen in: <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/answerhatch/">AnswerHatch</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/ndb-insights/">NDB Insights</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/foi-at-a-glance/">FOI at a Glance</a></p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="value-icon"><span class="ico ico--check"></span></span>
        <h3>Checked before it is served</h3>
        <p>Sources are pinned by their hash and figures are checked against published totals at start-up. A mismatch stops the service rather than showing a wrong number.</p>
        <p class="seen">Seen in: <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/foi-at-a-glance/">FOI at a Glance</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/ndb-insights/">NDB Insights</a></p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="value-icon"><span class="ico ico--usercheck"></span></span>
        <h3>People make the final call</h3>
        <p>Drafted strategies, risk registers and talent pathways are reviewed and owned by a person. A chatbot is tested on your own pages before you accept it.</p>
        <p class="seen">Seen in: <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/bluebird-horizon-workforce-planning/">Horizon</a> · <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/answerhatch/">AnswerHatch</a></p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="hosting-title">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Your data</p>
    <h2 id="hosting-title">Where your data sits</h2>
    <p>What each solution states about where it runs and how it handles information.</p>
  </div>
  <dl class="facts facts--wide">
    <div>
      <dt><a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/bluebird-horizon-workforce-planning/">Horizon</a></dt>
      <dd>Runs on infrastructure in Australia with locally hosted open-weights models, and no offshore processing. It can also be deployed into an agency-owned cloud subscription. No workforce data trains any foundation model.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt><a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/answerhatch/">AnswerHatch</a></dt>
      <dd>AnswerHatch states that customer traffic and data are processed in a single hosting region, Australia, on machines it operates, with no third-party model API in the path of an answer. It states that visitor questions are deleted after 30 days.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt><a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/foi-at-a-glance/">FOI at a Glance</a> and <a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/ndb-insights/">NDB Insights</a></dt>
      <dd>Work from published, aggregate government statistics.</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt><a href="/bluebird-ai-solutions/website-ai-risk-assessment/">Website AI risk assessment</a></dt>
      <dd>Looks at what is already publicly reachable on your sites, and is delivered by Bluebird's security-cleared team.</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</section>

